dding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong>CITY</strong></code>配合 city 字段使用，允许值：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Xg8flcNU\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CITY</code>&nbsp;省市</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-k3XmjDCi\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">COUNTY</code>&nbsp;区县</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-L6KA1HsI\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">NONE</code>&nbsp;不限，默认值</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t9ba4b99-NfLgGWL4\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dISeiQrj\">string</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-VItkaMGv\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t114fa75-TkvOcp32\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-X4HChQc0\">location_type</p></td><td data-id=\"t114fa75-8eEXAcBk\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: defaul